  "description": "Run WebDataStudio — a browser-based database studio for PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, SQLite, Oracle, DuckDB, ClickHouse, MongoDB and Redis — inside your Aspire stack. Attach any resource with a connection string via WithWebDataStudio() or WithReference(), share one studio across databases or run several, add accounts with roles, point its optional SQL assistant at Claude, ChatGPT, OpenRouter or a local Ollama, and serve it as an MCP server for AI agents — all from the app host.",
